**UNION-based SQL injection** (password hashing):
```sql
UNION SELECT 1 FROM users WHERE username='admin';
SELECT ? FROM users WHERE password = @password;
```

This works because `SELECT` runs first, `UNION` appends the second query to it, then `SELECT` runs last as the first result. By the time the `SELECT` executes, any malicious SQL has already been concatenated into its final form.

